---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import portraitImg from '../../assets/florian-portrait.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Florian Obermeier — Author"
  description="Two books, two poles. Florian Obermeier writes about technology that is changing the world — and about what lies beneath the noise."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrl="/"
>

<style>
  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 6rem 2.5rem 4rem;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    color: var(--teal);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow::before {
    content: '';
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--teal);
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 9vw, 6.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .hero h1 .amp {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
    padding: 0 0.1em;
  }
  .hero h1 .stille {
    font-style: italic;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--gold) 30%, #f5d28e 70%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--text);
    max-width: 600px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .hero-sub em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-heading);
  }
  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, background 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
  }
  .btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--teal);
    background: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.08);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .btn .arrow { transition: transform 0.3s; }
  .btn:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(3px); }
  .btn--ghost {
    border-color: transparent;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .btn--ghost:hover {
    color: var(--text-heading);
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
    background: transparent;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow,
  .hero h1,
  .hero-sub,
  .hero-cta {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* Portrait — right-side bleed, feathered mask, duotone tint, grain */
  .hero-portrait {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    right: calc(50% - 50vw);
    width: min(720px, 60vw);
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, transparent 16%, rgba(0,0,0,0.32) 36%, rgba(0,0,0,0.78) 58%, #000 76%);
            mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, transparent 16%, rgba(0,0,0,0.32) 36%, rgba(0,0,0,0.78) 58%, #000 76%);
  }
  .hero-portrait picture {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .hero-portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 32%;
    filter: saturate(0.72) contrast(1.06) brightness(0.86);
    transform: scale(1.06);
    transform-origin: 50% 25%;
    display: block;
  }
  .hero-portrait::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(72% 55% at 65% 22%, rgba(232, 169, 72, 0.32), transparent 65%),
      radial-gradient(60% 65% at 32% 80%, rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.18), transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 30%, rgba(10,10,11,0.45) 100%);
    mix-blend-mode: overlay;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-portrait-grain {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    opacity: 0.22;
    mix-blend-mode: overlay;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @supports (animation-timeline: scroll()) {
    .hero-portrait img {
      animation: hero-portrait-drift linear both;
      animation-timeline: scroll(root block);
      animation-range: 0 90vh;
    }
    @keyframes hero-portrait-drift {
      from { transform: translateY(-1.5%) scale(1.06); }
      to   { transform: translateY(5%) scale(1.09); }
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-portrait img {
      animation: none;
      transform: scale(1.06);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) and (max-width: 1023px) {
    .hero-portrait {
      width: min(440px, 48vw);
      opacity: 0.78;
      -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, transparent 26%, rgba(0,0,0,0.28) 48%, rgba(0,0,0,0.72) 70%, #000 86%);
              mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, transparent 26%, rgba(0,0,0,0.28) 48%, rgba(0,0,0,0.72) 70%, #000 86%);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero { padding: 7rem 1.25rem 3rem; }
    .hero-portrait {
      top: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0;
      width: 100%;
      opacity: 0.32;
      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(82% 65% at 75% 25%, #000 0%, transparent 62%);
              mask-image: radial-gradient(82% 65% at 75% 25%, #000 0%, transparent 62%);
    }
    .hero-portrait img {
      filter: saturate(0.55) contrast(1.05) brightness(0.55) blur(2px);
    }
  }

  /* SECTION SHELL */
  section.block {
    padding: 7rem 2.5rem;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .section-label::before {
    content: '';
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--text-dim);
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    section.block { padding: 4.5rem 1.25rem; }
    .section-label { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  }

  /* BOOKS */
  .books-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .books-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3.5rem; }
  }

  .book-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    transition: border-color 0.5s, transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), box-shadow 0.5s;
    position: relative;
  }
  .book-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 18px;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.5s;
    background: radial-gradient(600px circle at var(--mx, 50%) var(--my, 50%), rgba(255,255,255,0.05), transparent 40%);
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .book-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .book-card--signal:hover { border-color: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.35); box-shadow: 0 25px 60px -20px rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.18); }
  .book-card--stille:hover { border-color: rgba(232, 169, 72, 0.32); box-shadow: 0 25px 60px -20px rgba(232, 169, 72, 0.18); }

  .cover {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1071 / 1700;
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    background: #060308;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .cover img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
  }
  .book-card:hover .cover img { transform: scale(1.03); }

  .release-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.4rem;
    right: 1.4rem;
    width: 78px;
    height: 78px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #0a0a0b;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.25;
    transform: rotate(8deg);
    z-index: 3;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 28px rgba(232, 169, 72, 0.5);
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .badge-pre {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
  .badge-date {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .book-info {
    padding: 1.75rem 1.75rem 2rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .book-tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .book-tag::before {
    content: '';
    width: 6px; height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .book-tag--signal { color: var(--teal); }
  .book-tag--signal::before { background: var(--teal); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--teal); }
  .book-tag--stille { color: var(--gold); }
  .book-tag--stille::before { background: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--gold); }

  .book-title {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.4vw, 1.7rem);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .book-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .book-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .book-meta {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .book-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* COUNTDOWN */
  .countdown {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  .countdown-unit {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  .countdown-num {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 2ch;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .countdown-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .countdown-done {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  /* ABOUT */
  .about {
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  .about-lead {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 1.95rem);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .about-lead em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .about p {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .about p strong {
    color: var(--text-heading);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* NEWSLETTER */
  .newsletter-inner { max-width: 560px; }
  .newsletter-headline {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .newsletter-headline em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .newsletter-sub {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .newsletter-sub em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .nl-field {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .nl-input {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 180px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .nl-input::placeholder { color: var(--text-dim); }
  .nl-input:focus { border-color: var(--teal); }
  .nl-status {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    min-height: 1.4em;
  }
  .nl-status--ok { color: var(--teal); }
  .nl-status--err { color: #f87171; }

  /* CONTACT */
  .contact {
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: 7rem;
  }
  .contact-headline {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .contact-headline em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--teal);
  }
  .contact-sub {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .contact-mail {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.4vw, 1.7rem);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .contact-mail:hover {
    border-color: var(--teal);
    color: var(--teal);
  }
  .contact-socials {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
</style>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">Florian Obermeier — Author</p>
  <h1>Signal<span class="amp"> &amp; </span><span class="stille">Stille</span></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Two books, two poles. One explains a technology that is changing the world. The other searches for <em>what lies beneath</em> — when the noise finally falls silent.</p>
  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a href="#buecher" class="btn">Discover books <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    <a href="#ueber" class="btn btn--ghost">About me</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-portrait" aria-hidden="true">
    <Picture
      src={portraitImg}
      formats={['avif', 'webp']}
      widths={[400, 600, 800, 1100, 1440]}
      sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1023px) 48vw, min(720px, 60vw)"
      alt=""
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <svg class="hero-portrait-grain" viewBox="0 0 200 200" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <filter id="hp-noise">
        <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.85" numOctaves="2" stitchTiles="stitch" />
        <feColorMatrix type="saturate" values="0" />
        <feComponentTransfer><feFuncA type="linear" slope="1" intercept="-0.5" /></feComponentTransfer>
      </filter>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" filter="url(#hp-noise)" />
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BOOKS -->
<section id="buecher" class="block">
  <p class="section-label reveal">Two Books</p>
  <div class="books-grid">

    <!-- BOOK 1: Signal -->
    <article class="book-card book-card--signal reveal" data-tilt>
      <div class="cover cover--ki">
        <img src="/cover-ki.jpg" alt="Cover: Why AI Is Not Just Hype" width="1200" height="1905" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="book-info">
        <p class="book-tag book-tag--signal">Signal — Non-Fiction</p>
        <h2 class="book-title">Why AI Is Not Just Hype</h2>
        <p class="book-subtitle">and how it is fundamentally changing our everyday lives</p>
        <p class="book-desc">
          Not a researcher, not a developer — but someone who knows IT from the inside: over ten years as a team lead and manager in the industry. In late 2022 he opened ChatGPT and realized this wasn't the next trend. In 2024 he went to Silicon Valley to see for himself who's actually building this, and why. The result is 586 pages: what AI can do today, and where it's heading next. For everyone who's tired of the hype — and finally wants to understand what's actually going on.
        </p>
        <p class="book-meta">2025 · 586 pages · BoD · ISBN 978-3-6951-7324-2 · Available in German</p>
        <div class="book-actions">
          <a href="https://www.amazon.de/Warum-kein-Hype-ist-grundlegend/dp/3695173246" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">On Amazon <span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
          <a href="https://buchshop.bod.de/warum-ki-kein-hype-ist-florian-obermeier-9783695173242" class="btn btn--ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BoD ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- BOOK 2: Stille -->
    <article class="book-card book-card--stille reveal" data-tilt>
      <div class="cover">
        <img src="/cover-stille.jpg" alt="Cover: You Only Hear It When It Falls Silent" width="1071" height="1700" loading="lazy" />
        <div class="release-badge" aria-label="Out 30 May">
          <span class="badge-pre">OUT</span>
          <span class="badge-date">30 MAY</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="book-info">
        <p class="book-tag book-tag--stille">Stille — Memoir with Soundtrack</p>
        <h2 class="book-title">You Only Hear It When It Falls Silent</h2>
        <p class="book-subtitle">A Book with Soundtrack</p>
        <p class="book-desc">
          Everything was running. The job, the calendar, the role nobody would think to question. Until the body starts doing things that can no longer be explained. A record of the journey through silence. Plus 16 songs: one for each of the 13 chapters, three more that belong to the story. All written by him and produced with Suno, because some things can't be written, only heard.
        </p>
        <p class="book-meta">Out 30 May 2026 · 13 Chapters · 16 Songs · BoD · Available in German</p>
        <div class="countdown" id="countdown-stille" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="countdown-unit">
            <span class="countdown-num" id="cd-days">--</span>
            <span class="countdown-label">Days</span>
          </div>
          <div class="countdown-unit">
            <span class="countdown-num" id="cd-hours">--</span>
            <span class="countdown-label">Hrs</span>
          </div>
          <div class="countdown-unit">
            <span class="countdown-num" id="cd-mins">--</span>
            <span class="countdown-label">Min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="countdown-unit">
            <span class="countdown-num" id="cd-secs">--</span>
            <span class="countdown-label">Sec</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="book-actions">
          <a href="mailto:kontakt@florian-obermeier.com?subject=You%20Only%20Hear%20It%20When%20It%20Falls%20Silent" class="btn">Enquire <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- RELEASE REMINDER -->
<section id="erinnerung" class="block">
  <p class="section-label reveal">Coming Soon</p>
  <div class="newsletter-inner">
    <h2 class="newsletter-headline reveal">Be there when it <em>falls silent</em>.</h2>
    <p class="newsletter-sub reveal">My second book, <em>You Only Hear It When It Falls Silent</em>, is out on 30 May 2026. Leave your email and I'll remind you the moment it's here. No newsletter, never shared.</p>
    <form class="reveal" id="nl-form" novalidate>
      <div class="nl-field">
        <input class="nl-input" type="email" id="nl-email" placeholder="your@email.com" autocomplete="email" required />
        <button class="btn" type="submit">
          <span id="nl-btn-label">Remind me</span>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="nl-status" id="nl-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="ueber" class="block">
  <p class="section-label reveal">About</p>
  <div class="about">
    <p class="about-lead reveal">
      I live in the Bavarian Forest. Where the map is green, where hills calm the gaze and dead zones often decide on phone calls faster than you do. A good place to <em>think</em>.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      For a long time, that wasn't my world. IT and Sales by day, side projects on top, on the road almost every weekend. Events, concerts. Always loud, always busy. I was the one people called when something had to run, and I usually said the next yes before I'd thought about it. For a while it felt like achievement. Until my body disagreed.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      These days I live more deliberately. I listen more often before I answer. To myself too, which is actually the harder of the two.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      What I keep thinking about doesn't fit neatly into one discipline. AI hasn't let me go in years. But just as much, the question of why so many people keep functioning until their body decides for them. I was one of them.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      I don't believe you always have to be strong. But I do believe you shouldn't stay alone with it.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

